ion of the stern  mosque mystery an expansion of home on  and a cast of characters that tie  incredibly closely to that of the part 1  crew and I actually wish that Stardust  Crusaders had been able to escalate this  further because in my opinion just  bringing back deer who doesn't quite cut  it and it still feels like it's an  adventure which I guess is also fine I  just think that saying that pot 2 is the  old one out is a very strange statement  but once again to each their own as for  me though I've come out of this  discussion with a new appreciation for  the flaws of battle tendency and I  completely understand those who rate  this part exceptionally low the story is  admittedly pretty standard many of the  characters are quite underutilized and  the part suffering from over hype is  only going to exacerbate those issues I  still think for what it is though battle  10  he comes close to maximizing what it  wants to be in the time allotted to it  and once again the fact that this part  is so short makes many if not all of the  very real issues much more forgivable  than issues in later parts because they  are far more enduring tales and as a  result set issues can become quite the  test of endurance but what do you guys  think please do feel free to share your  thoughts on battle tendency in the  comments below  well even join my discourse server if  you're keen for some more Georgia  content then please do go and check out  all my other videos we'll even subscribe  to the channel for regular Georgia  wander delivered straight into your  YouTube feed but for now this has been  the New World review and I'll see you  next time

